@startuml feature-mushroom-probability
title Mushroom Probability Detail Feature Flow

' Status: Planned

actor User
actor "Privileged Contributor" as Contributor
participant "Mushroom Detail View" as MushroomDetailView
participant "Probability Explanation" as ProbabilityExplanation
participant "Feedback Review Flow" as FeedbackReviewFlow
actor "Highest-level Admin" as Admin
participant "Species Algorithm Settings" as SpeciesAlgorithmSettings

User -> MushroomDetailView: Open mushroom detail
MushroomDetailView --> User: Show readiness label, probability, confidence, and seasonal state

User -> ProbabilityExplanation: Open explanation
ProbabilityExplanation --> User: Show understandable seasonal, weather, and species-profile inputs and how they affect the result

alt User only wants transparency
	ProbabilityExplanation --> User: Explain why readiness and confidence are high, medium, or low
else Contributor and admin features are used later
	Contributor -> FeedbackReviewFlow: Submit species-specific improvement input
	Admin -> SpeciesAlgorithmSettings: Review accepted input and adjust species algorithm settings
	SpeciesAlgorithmSettings --> User: Show when a species-specific rule change affects visible explanation
end

note right of FeedbackReviewFlow
The exact contributor submission, review, and approval
workflow is intentionally deferred.
The important product requirement is transparent handling
of suggestions and transparent impact on the visible logic.
end note

@enduml
